{"page":57,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:53","surah":3,"ayah":53,"ar_uthmani":"رَبَّنَآ ءَامَنَّا بِمَآ أَنزَلْتَ وَٱتَّبَعْنَا ٱلرَّسُولَ فَٱكْتُبْنَا مَعَ ٱلشَّـٰهِدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Lord, we believe in what You have revealed and we follow the messenger: record us among those who bear witness [to the Truth].’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"رَبَّنَآ","en_gloss":"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"3:53"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَامَنَّا","en_gloss":"we believe[d]","transliteration":"āmannā","verse_key":"3:53"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِمَآ","en_gloss":"in what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"3:53"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَنزَلْتَ","en_gloss":"You revealed","transliteration":"anzalta","verse_key":"3:53"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱتَّبَعْنَا","en_gloss":"and we follow[ed]","transliteration":"wa-ittabaʿnā","verse_key":"3:53"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولَ","en_gloss":"the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūla","verse_key":"3:53"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَٱكْتُبْنَا","en_gloss":"then write us","transliteration":"fa-uk'tub'nā","verse_key":"3:53"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَعَ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"maʿa","verse_key":"3:53"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلشَّـٰهِدِينَ","en_gloss":"the witnesses","transliteration":"l-shāhidīna","verse_key":"3:53"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٥٣","en_gloss":"(53)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:53"}]},{"verse_key":"3:54","surah":3,"ayah":54,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَكَرُوا۟ وَمَكَرَ ٱللَّهُ ۖ وَٱللَّهُ خَيْرُ ٱلْمَـٰكِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The [disbelievers] schemed but God also schemed; God is the Best of Schemers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَكَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they schemed","transliteration":"wamakarū","verse_key":"3:54"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَمَكَرَ","en_gloss":"and planned","transliteration":"wamakara","verse_key":"3:54"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۖ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"3:54"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"3:54"},{"pos":5,"ar":"خَيْرُ","en_gloss":"(is the) best","transliteration":"khayru","verse_key":"3:54"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْمَـٰكِرِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the planners","transliteration":"l-mākirīna","verse_key":"3:54"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٥٤","en_gloss":"(54)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:54"}]},{"verse_key":"3:55","surah":3,"ayah":55,"ar_uthmani":"إِذْ قَالَ ٱللَّهُ يَـٰعِيسَىٰٓ إِنِّى مُتَوَفِّيكَ وَرَافِعُكَ إِلَىَّ وَمُطَهِّرُكَ مِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ وَجَاعِلُ ٱلَّذِينَ ٱتَّبَعُوكَ فَوْقَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوٓا۟ إِلَىٰ يَوْمِ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۖ ثُمَّ إِلَىَّ مَرْجِعُكُمْ فَأَحْكُمُ بَيْنَكُمْ فِيمَا كُنتُمْ فِيهِ تَخْتَلِفُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God said, ‘Jesus, I will take you back and raise you up to Me: I will purify you of the disbelievers. To the Day of Resurrection I will make those who follow you superior to those who disbelieved. Then you will all return to Me and I will judge between you regarding your differences.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"When","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"3:55"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"3:55"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"3:55"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَـٰعِيسَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"O Isa","transliteration":"yāʿīsā","verse_key":"3:55"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِنِّى","en_gloss":"Indeed, I","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"3:55"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مُتَوَفِّيكَ","en_gloss":"(will) take you","transliteration":"mutawaffīka","verse_key":"3:55"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَرَافِعُكَ","en_gloss":"and raise you","transliteration":"warāfiʿuka","verse_key":"3:55"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَىَّ","en_gloss":"to Myself","transliteration":"ilayya","verse_key":"3:55"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمُطَهِّرُكَ","en_gloss":"and purify you","transliteration":"wamuṭahhiruka","verse_key":"3:55"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"3:55"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:55"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"